The **BOHOL 7-inch mini snack and drink vending machine** uses the ZD-C-7 catalogue platform: a compact spiral-channel cabinet with a 7-inch touchscreen reference interface and a 6 × 6 channel layout. The catalogue lists H1955 × W800 × D850 mm including casters, 180 kg reference weight and capacity of approximately 180-720 items depending on product size. The supplied red branded images are promotional concepts. Payment hardware, refrigeration, connectivity, artwork, channel capacity and all destination-market requirements must be confirmed in the approved order specification.

Send BOHOL representative products, target market, site measurements, payment-provider requirements, branding files and estimated quantity for a configuration review.
